1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,240
Video ya leo ni nini? Ni kuhusu tips za maisha na adabu nchini Japani. Wajapani hawafanyi hivyo.

2
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,740
Sehemu ya 1: Sarafu za Japani na uzito wa pochi / Sarafu za Kijapani na Uzito wa Mkoba

3
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:15,874
Safari yangu nchini Japani ilikuwa ya furaha sana.

4
00:00:15,897 --> 00:00:18,548
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

5
00:00:18,571 --> 00:00:24,805
Lakini kabla ya kuja Japani, kulikuwa na kitu nilitaka kujua.

6
00:00:24,828 --> 00:00:27,167
Ni kitu gani?

7
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,925
Ni kuhusu pesa.

8
00:00:29,948 --> 00:00:31,882
Pesa?

9
00:00:31,905 --> 00:00:37,582
Ndiyo. Sarafu za Japani ni nyingi sana, sivyo?

10
00:00:37,605 --> 00:00:39,644
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

11
00:00:39,668 --> 00:00:48,239
Kuna sarafu za senti 1, 5, 10, 50, 100 na 500.

12
00:00:48,262 --> 00:00:54,196
Ndiyo. Nchini kwangu, tunatumia zaidi noti.

13
00:00:54,219 --> 00:00:57,485
Kama noti ya dola 1, kwa mfano.

14
00:00:57,508 --> 00:01:02,042
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, mkoba wangu hauzidi uzito.

15
00:01:02,065 --> 00:01:06,065
Je, mkoba wako ulikuwa mzito nchini Japani?

16
00:01:06,087 --> 00:01:12,454
Ndiyo, mkoba wangu ulikuwa mzito sana nchini Japani.

17
00:01:12,477 --> 00:01:14,521
Kwa nini?

18
00:01:14,544 --> 00:01:20,357
Kwa sababu nilinunua vinywaji kila siku kutoka kwa mashine za kuuza.

19
00:01:20,381 --> 00:01:23,275
Mashine hizo ni rahisi sana.

20
00:01:23,298 --> 00:01:29,865
Ndiyo. Lakini nilitumia noti ya yen 1000 kila wakati.

21
00:01:29,888 --> 00:01:32,587
Kwa hiyo, ulipata pesa ya mchanga.

22
00:01:32,611 --> 00:01:38,777
Ndiyo. Sarafu za yen 100 na 500 zilikuwa nyingi sana.

23
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,093
Sarafu zinakuwa nyingi, sivyo?

24
00:01:43,117 --> 00:01:47,721
Ndiyo. Mkoba wangu ulikuwa umejaa sarafu.

25
00:01:47,744 --> 00:01:49,997
Ulikuwa mzito, sivyo?

26
00:01:50,021 --> 00:01:54,240
Ndiyo. Suruali yangu ilishuka kidogo.

27
00:01:54,263 --> 00:01:57,330
Hiyo ilikuwa vigumu.

28
00:01:57,353 --> 00:02:03,805
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, kabla ya kuja Japani, ningependa kujua hili.

29
00:02:03,828 --> 00:02:05,565
Ni nini?

30
00:02:05,588 --> 00:02:09,440
Ninahitaji pochi ndogo ya sarafu.

31
00:02:09,464 --> 00:02:12,268
Pochi ya sarafu pekee, sivyo?

32
00:02:12,291 --> 00:02:18,188
Ndiyo. Ikiwa una hiyo, mkoba wako wa kawaida utakuwa mwepesi.

33
00:02:18,212 --> 00:02:20,454
Hiyo ni rahisi sana.

34
00:02:20,478 --> 00:02:26,044
Ndiyo. Unaweza kununua pochi nzuri hata katika maduka ya yen 100.

35
00:02:26,067 --> 00:02:30,243
Ndiyo, kuna miundo mingi tofauti.

36
00:02:30,267 --> 00:02:34,667
Ndiyo. Mimi sikujua hili.

37
00:02:34,690 --> 00:02:39,664
Ikiwa unajua kabla ya safari, unaweza kujiandaa vizuri.

38
00:02:39,687 --> 00:02:44,663
Ndiyo. Hii ni tips muhimu sana.

39
00:02:44,687 --> 00:02:53,696
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu.

40
00:02:53,696 --> 00:02:55,196
Sehemu ya 2: Ukosefu wa vipipa vya taka nchini Japani / Ukosefu wa Vipipa vya Taka nchini Japani

41
00:02:55,196 --> 00:03:02,407
Je, kuna chochote kingine ulichokuwa unataka kujua kabla ya kuja Japani?

42
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:04,120
Ndiyo.

43
00:03:04,144 --> 00:03:07,477
Ni kuhusu vipipa vya taka barabarani.

44
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,594
Vipipa vya taka?

45
00:03:09,618 --> 00:03:11,585
Ndiyo.

46
00:03:11,608 --> 00:03:16,774
Barabarani nchini Japani, vipipa vya taka havipo kabisa.

47
00:03:16,797 --> 00:03:18,597
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

48
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:21,787
Vipipa vya taka ni chache sana.

49
00:03:21,810 --> 00:03:28,423
Nilipokuja Japani kwa mara ya kwanza, nilishangaa sana.

50
00:03:28,446 --> 00:03:31,925
Ulikuwa unataka kutupa taka?

51
00:03:31,949 --> 00:03:33,749
Ndiyo.

52
00:03:33,772 --> 00:03:38,373
Nilinunua chakula kitamu na nikakula nje.

53
00:03:38,396 --> 00:03:42,466
Baada ya hapo, nilitaka kutupa taka.

54
00:03:42,489 --> 00:03:46,856
Lakini, hakukuwa na kidimbwi cha taka.

55
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,578
Ndiyo.

56
00:03:48,602 --> 00:03:54,335
Niliwaangalia karibu na kituo cha treni na madukani kwa muda mrefu.

57
00:03:54,358 --> 00:03:57,125
Ilikuwa vigumu sana, eeh.

58
00:03:57,148 --> 00:03:59,007
Ndiyo.

59
00:03:59,031 --> 00:04:02,210
Kwa nini hakuna vidimbwi vya taka?

60
00:04:02,234 --> 00:04:08,600
Zamani, kwa ajili ya usalama, vidimbwi vya taka mjini viliondolewa.

61
00:04:08,623 --> 00:04:10,957
Kwa ajili ya usalama?

62
00:04:10,980 --> 00:04:12,780
Ndiyo.

63
00:04:12,803 --> 00:04:15,680
Kuna sababu maalum.

64
00:04:15,703 --> 00:04:17,675
Nimeelewa.

65
00:04:17,698 --> 00:04:22,531
Kwa hiyo, kila mtu hupeleka taka zake nyumbani, ndiyo?

66
00:04:22,554 --> 00:04:24,209
Ndiyo.

67
00:04:24,232 --> 00:04:25,643
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

68
00:04:25,667 --> 00:04:30,400
Lakini, niliuona kisanduku kilichofanana na kidimbwi cha taka.

69
00:04:30,423 --> 00:04:32,860
Ulikuwa wapi?

70
00:04:32,884 --> 00:04:36,684
Karibu na mashine ya kuuza vinywaji.

71
00:04:36,707 --> 00:04:39,073
Kulikuwa na kisanduku pale.

72
00:04:39,096 --> 00:04:42,163
Aa, hicho ndicho.

73
00:04:42,186 --> 00:04:45,986
Lakini, hicho si kidimbwi cha taka.

74
00:04:46,009 --> 00:04:47,776
Eeh?

75
00:04:47,799 --> 00:04:49,819
Ni kweli hiyo?

76
00:04:49,842 --> 00:04:51,575
Ndiyo.

77
00:04:51,598 --> 00:04:54,484
Hicho ni kisanduku cha kuchagua taka za kusanyikwa tena (recycle).

78
00:04:54,507 --> 00:04:56,841
Kusanyikwa tena (recycle)?

79
00:04:56,864 --> 00:04:58,706
Ndiyo.

80
00:04:58,729 --> 00:05:02,162
Huweka makopo na chupa za plastiki pekee.

81
00:05:02,185 --> 00:05:04,041
Nimeelewa.

82
00:05:04,065 --> 00:05:06,882
Je, mifuko ya vitambaa vya chakula vinaweza kuwekwa?

83
00:05:06,905 --> 00:05:08,475
Ndiyo.

84
00:05:08,499 --> 00:05:12,032
Haitakiwi kuweka taka za chakula kwenye hicho kisanduku.

85
00:05:12,055 --> 00:05:14,508
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

86
00:05:14,531 --> 00:05:16,531
Ni adabu.

87
00:05:16,554 --> 00:05:18,448
Ndiyo.

88
00:05:18,472 --> 00:05:22,722
Watu wa Japani wote wanashika kanuni hiyo.

89
00:05:22,745 --> 00:05:28,243
Lakini, kunishinda kunabeba taka kwa mkono kwa muda mrefu.

90
00:05:28,266 --> 00:05:31,233
Mfuko utakuwa chafu.

91
00:05:31,256 --> 00:05:32,893
Ndiyo.

92
00:05:32,917 --> 00:05:38,150
Kwa hiyo, hii pia ningependa kujua kabla ya kuja Japani.

93
00:05:38,173 --> 00:05:40,232
Ni kitu gani?

94
00:05:40,256 --> 00:05:45,464
Wekea mfuko mdogo wa plastiki kwenye begi yako.

95
00:05:45,487 --> 00:05:48,687
Mfuko unaopewa unapo nunua bidhaa, ndiyo?

96
00:05:48,710 --> 00:05:50,282
Ndiyo.

97
00:05:50,306 --> 00:05:53,715
Wekea taka zako kwenye mfuko huo.

98
00:05:53,739 --> 00:05:56,472
Kisha funga mdomo wake.

99
00:05:56,495 --> 00:06:00,098
Kwa njia hiyo, begi yako haita chafuka.

100
00:06:00,121 --> 00:06:01,759
Ndiyo.

101
00:06:01,782 --> 00:06:05,582
Ukirudi hotelini, utaweza kutupa taka.

102
00:06:05,605 --> 00:06:08,572
Wazo zuri sana!

103
00:06:08,595 --> 00:06:10,240
Ndiyo.

104
00:06:10,264 --> 00:06:14,197
Hii ni kanuni msingi ya kusafiri Japani.

105
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:21,325
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua somo la video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

106
00:06:21,325 --> 00:06:22,825
Sehemu ya 3: Matatizo ya Vyoo vya Japani / Changamoto za Vyoo vya Japani

107
00:06:22,825 --> 00:06:26,836
Baada ya taka, sasa ni suala la vyoo.

108
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:28,509
Vyoo?

109
00:06:28,532 --> 00:06:32,783
Vyoo vya Japani ni safi sana!

110
00:06:32,806 --> 00:06:36,497
Ndiyo, ni safi kweli.

111
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:40,687
Lakini, nilikumbana na changamoto ndogo.

112
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:42,843
Ni kitu gani?

113
00:06:42,866 --> 00:06:47,939
Baada ya kunawa mikono, hakukuwa na karatasi ya kukaushia.

114
00:06:47,963 --> 00:06:51,211
Aa, karatasi ya kunywa mikono (paper towel).

115
00:06:51,235 --> 00:06:57,413
Ndiyo. Nchini kwangu, kuna karatasi ya aina hiyo kila wakati.

116
00:06:57,436 --> 00:06:59,770
Nimeelewa.

117
00:06:59,793 --> 00:07:03,870
Kwenye vyoo vya Japani, karibu hakuna.

118
00:07:03,893 --> 00:07:08,665
Hata mashine ya kukausha mikono haikuwa inafanya kazi.

119
00:07:08,689 --> 00:07:14,622
Ndiyo. Kwa sababu ni hatua za kuzuia maradhi, kwa sasa haifai kutumika.

120
00:07:14,645 --> 00:07:19,249
Kwa hiyo, nilifuta mikono yangu iliyovwilika kwenye suruali yangu.

121
00:07:19,273 --> 00:07:23,040
Haha, hiyo ilikuwa tatizo kidogo, sivyo?

122
00:07:23,063 --> 00:07:27,496
Ndiyo. Watu wa Japani hufanya vipi?

123
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:32,154
Kila mtu huwa na kitambaa chake cha mkono au taulo.

124
00:07:32,178 --> 00:07:35,986
Je, wanaume pia huwa na vitambaa vya mkono?

125
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:40,810
Ndiyo. Bila shaka, wanaume pia huwa navyo.

126
00:07:40,833 --> 00:07:42,866
Nimeelewa.

127
00:07:42,889 --> 00:07:47,547
Ningependa kujua hilo kabla ya kuja Japani.

128
00:07:47,571 --> 00:07:52,104
Kila siku, weka kitambaa kidogo cha mkono kwenye begi yako.

129
00:07:52,127 --> 00:07:58,860
Ndiyo. Nilipernuka taulo ndogo nzuri nyingi Japani.

130
00:07:58,883 --> 00:08:00,952
Nzuri sana!

131
00:08:00,976 --> 00:08:04,421
Zinatosheleza sana kama zawadi pia.

132
00:08:04,445 --> 00:08:09,022
Ndiyo, marafiki wangu walifurahi sana.

133
00:08:09,045 --> 00:08:13,245
Je, ulikumbana na matatizo mengine chochote kwenye choo?

134
00:08:13,268 --> 00:08:19,538
Ndiyo. Kwenye choo cha bustani ya zamani, hapakuwa na sabuni.

135
00:08:19,562 --> 00:08:24,045
Aa, kuna vyoo ambavyo havina sabuni pia.

136
00:08:24,069 --> 00:08:28,310
Kwa kuwa sikupata kunawa mikono, nilikwama sana.

137
00:08:28,333 --> 00:08:33,206
Wakati kama huo, sabuni ya kubebea ni muhimu.

138
00:08:33,229 --> 00:08:36,031
Sabuni ya kubebea?

139
00:08:36,054 --> 00:08:42,188
Ndiyo. Kuna sabuni ndogo za karatasi na za kiowevu.

140
00:08:42,211 --> 00:08:44,983
Hizo zinapatikana wapi?

141
00:08:45,006 --> 00:08:49,822
Unaweza kununua katika maduka ya vitu vyote kwa shilingi 100 au maduka ya dawa.

142
00:08:49,846 --> 00:08:54,413
Maduka ya vitu vyote kwa shilingi 100? Ni rahisi sana!

143
00:08:54,436 --> 00:09:00,369
Ndiyo. Kwa sababu ni ndogo, haziwezi kufanya begi yako kuwa nzito.

144
00:09:00,392 --> 00:09:02,327
Nzuri sana!

145
00:09:02,350 --> 00:09:06,444
Ningependa kujua hili pia kabla ya kuja Japani.

146
00:09:06,468 --> 00:09:11,315
Ndiyo. Kuwa na maandalizi kunakupa amani.

147
00:09:11,338 --> 00:09:12,838
Sehemu ya 4: Adabu za Kula Wakati wa Kutembea

148
00:09:12,838 --> 00:09:18,275
Sasa tutazungumzia adabu za chakula. Adabu?

149
00:09:18,298 --> 00:09:21,075
Ulikumbana na nini?

150
00:09:21,099 --> 00:09:25,379
Kula wakati wa kutembea.

151
00:09:25,402 --> 00:09:29,441
Aa, kula wakati wa kutembea.

152
00:09:29,464 --> 00:09:31,237
Ndiyo.

153
00:09:31,261 --> 00:09:36,395
Nchini kwangu ni kawaida, lakini Japani si halali?

154
00:09:36,418 --> 00:09:38,253
Ndiyo.

155
00:09:38,276 --> 00:09:42,710
Japani, hakuruhusiwi kula wakati wa kutembea.

156
00:09:42,733 --> 00:09:46,933
Kwa nini hakuruhusiwi kula wakati wa kutembea?

157
00:09:46,956 --> 00:09:52,834
Kwa sababu unaweza kuchafua nguo za watu wengine, haina adabu.

158
00:09:52,857 --> 00:09:54,591
Nguo?

159
00:09:54,614 --> 00:09:59,380
Hakika, ikiwa ketchup itaanguka, itakuwa tatizo kubwa!

160
00:09:59,403 --> 00:10:01,097
Ndiyo.

161
00:10:01,121 --> 00:10:05,754
Kwa hiyo, kula karibu na duka unalolipata chakula.

162
00:10:05,777 --> 00:10:08,311
Kando ya duka, sivyo?

163
00:10:08,334 --> 00:10:10,340
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

164
00:10:10,363 --> 00:10:14,101
Kula huko kwanza, kisha tembea.

165
00:10:14,125 --> 00:10:16,058
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

166
00:10:16,081 --> 00:10:19,118
Je, karibu na konbini pia ni sawa?

167
00:10:19,141 --> 00:10:20,675
Ndiyo.

168
00:10:20,698 --> 00:10:25,498
Kula karibu na konbini au kwenye benchi karibu na hapo.

169
00:10:25,521 --> 00:10:27,979
Je, aiskrimu?

170
00:10:28,002 --> 00:10:32,619
Aiskrimu pia, kula mbele ya duka.

171
00:10:32,642 --> 00:10:34,455
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

172
00:10:34,479 --> 00:10:36,812
Kula pale pale.

173
00:10:36,835 --> 00:10:40,802
Pia, adabu za treni ni muhimu.

174
00:10:40,826 --> 00:10:42,959
Treni, sivyo?

175
00:10:42,982 --> 00:10:47,382
Treni za Japani zilikuwa kimya kabisa.

176
00:10:47,405 --> 00:10:49,206
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

177
00:10:49,229 --> 00:10:52,431
Kila mtu alikuwa kimya sana.

178
00:10:52,455 --> 00:10:57,327
Nilitaka kupiga simu kwenye treni.

179
00:10:57,351 --> 00:11:00,284
Je, umepiga simu?

180
00:11:00,307 --> 00:11:06,401
Hapana. Kwa sababu hakukuwa na mtu niliyekuwa naweza kusema naye, sikupiga simu.

181
00:11:06,424 --> 00:11:08,558
Vizuri sana.

182
00:11:08,581 --> 00:11:12,028
Haupaswi kupiga simu ndani ya treni.

183
00:11:12,051 --> 00:11:15,018
Je, na simu ya mkononi?

184
00:11:15,041 --> 00:11:18,060
Weka kwenye hali isiyotolea sauti.

185
00:11:18,084 --> 00:11:20,503
Mode ya adabu, ndiyo?

186
00:11:20,526 --> 00:11:23,023
Ndiyo, hiyo hiyo.

187
00:11:23,047 --> 00:11:26,489
Je, ni mbaya kusikiliza muziki kwa spika?

188
00:11:26,513 --> 00:11:29,446
Ndiyo, ni mbaya.

189
00:11:29,469 --> 00:11:32,202
Tumia headphones.

190
00:11:32,225 --> 00:11:37,592
Ni tofauti kabisa na nchi yangu, kwa hiyo nilishtuka sana mwanzoni.

191
00:11:37,615 --> 00:11:41,651
Lakini, treni tulivu ni nzuri, sivyo?

192
00:11:41,674 --> 00:11:45,132
Ndiyo, ilikuwa nzuri sana.

193
00:11:45,155 --> 00:11:49,048
Kwa sababu ni tulivu, niliweza kulala vizuri.

194
00:11:49,071 --> 00:11:50,671
Hehe, ndivyo.

195
00:11:50,694 --> 00:11:53,961
Watu wengi wanapenda kulala ndani ya treni hapa.

196
00:11:53,984 --> 00:11:55,584
Ndiyo.

197
00:11:55,607 --> 00:12:00,240
Treni za Japani ni salama sana, kwa hiyo unaweza kuwa na amani.

198
00:12:00,263 --> 00:12:03,673
Ndiyo, kweli kabisa.

199
00:12:03,697 --> 00:12:08,297
Kujua adabu hufanya safari yako kuwa ya furaha zaidi.

200
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,899
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

201
00:12:09,922 --> 00:12:14,219
Zingatia adabu ili ufurahie safari yako.

202
00:12:14,242 --> 00:12:15,742
Sehemu ya 5: Matatizo ya Mtandao na Wi-Fi / Matatizo ya Mtandao na Wi-Fi Wakati wa Kusafiri

203
00:12:15,742 --> 00:12:20,309
Baada ya treni, sasa ni suala la mtandao.

204
00:12:20,332 --> 00:12:22,665
Mtandao?

205
00:12:22,688 --> 00:12:28,124
Ndiyo, nilikabili matatizo makubwa wakati wa safari yangu.

206
00:12:28,147 --> 00:12:30,681
Kwa nini?

207
00:12:30,704 --> 00:12:35,002
Niliwasili uwanja wa ndege wa Japani.

208
00:12:35,025 --> 00:12:39,993
Baada ya hapo, nilitaka kwenda hoteli mara moja.

209
00:12:40,016 --> 00:12:42,249
Ndiyo, hilo ndilo.

210
00:12:42,272 --> 00:12:46,506
Lakini sikuelewa jinsi ya kubadilisha treni.

211
00:12:46,529 --> 00:12:51,095
Je, hukutafuta kwa simu yako ya mkononi?

212
00:12:51,118 --> 00:12:55,392
Nilitaka kutumia Wi-Fi bure ya uwanja wa ndege.

213
00:12:55,416 --> 00:12:59,482
Lakini haikufanya kazi kabisa.

214
00:12:59,505 --> 00:13:06,239
Aa, Wi-Fi ya uwanja wa ndege mara kwa mara haina uhusiano.

215
00:13:06,262 --> 00:13:11,201
Ndiyo, kwa hiyo sikuelewa njia ya treni.

216
00:13:11,225 --> 00:13:15,025
Hilo lilikuwa tatizo kubwa.

217
00:13:15,047 --> 00:13:18,781
Ndiyo, nilikuwa na wasiwasi sana.

218
00:13:18,804 --> 00:13:24,837
Mtandao, unapaswa kujiandaa kabla ya kuja Japani.

219
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:26,956
