Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia mara moja kwa kupitia mipangilio ya simu yako.

223
00:13:42,877 --> 00:13:45,243
Hiyo ni rahisi sana.

224
00:13:45,266 --> 00:13:50,400
Ndiyo, naweka kabla ya kufika Japani.

225
00:13:50,423 --> 00:13:56,823
Kwa kufanya hivyo, unaweza kutumia mtandao mara moja uwanjani.

226
00:13:56,846 --> 00:14:02,379
Nimeelewa. Sikujua hilo.

227
00:14:02,402 --> 00:14:05,820
Kuna pia Pocket Wi-Fi.

228
00:14:05,844 --> 00:14:08,377
Pocket Wi-Fi?

229
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:13,139
Ndiyo, unaweza kuhifadhi mtandaoni.

230
00:14:13,162 --> 00:14:17,058
