237
00:14:43,654 --> 00:14:49,620
Kwa hiyo, hakikisha unajiandaa kabla ya kuja Japani.

238
00:14:49,643 --> 00:14:55,577
Ndiyo, safarini ijayo nitajiandaa na eSIM.

239
00:14:55,600 --> 00:15:00,734
Fanya hivyo. Ni salama sana.

