Kwa sababu sina mzigo mzito, safari ilikuwa rahisi sana.

275
00:17:22,462 --> 00:17:26,862
Mwili hauchoki, ni nzuri, kweli.

276
00:17:26,885 --> 00:17:30,937
Ndiyo, nilipewa msaada mkubwa.

277
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:36,037
Safarini ijayo, nitatumia huduma hii bila shaka.

278
00:17:36,061 --> 00:17:38,194
Fanya hivyo.

279
