Nimeelewa.

299
00:18:46,807 --> 00:18:50,545
Je, ulichukua hatua yoyote nzuri?

300
00:18:50,568 --> 00:18:54,302
Hapana, sikujua chochote.

301
00:18:54,325 --> 00:18:59,763
Kwa hiyo, hii pia ningependa kujua kabla ya kuja Japani.

302
00:18:59,786 --> 00:19:02,353
