303
00:19:02,376 --> 00:19:07,213
Nunua karatasi ya buluu katika duka la dawa.

304
00:19:07,236 --> 00:19:10,931
Aa, karatasi ambayo huweka kwenye miguu, ndiyo?

305
00:19:10,955 --> 00:19:12,398
Ndiyo.

306
00:19:12,421 --> 00:19:15,880
Uweke kwenye miguu yako na kulala.

307
00:19:15,904 --> 00:19:17,304
Ilichangia nini?

308
00:19:17,327 --> 00:19:22,193
Asubuhi iliyofuata, miguu yangu ilikuwa nyepesi sana!

309
00:19:22,216 --> 00:19:25,149
Nilishangaa sana!

310
00:19:25,172 --> 00:19:28,147
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

311
00:19:28,171 --> 00:19:30,846
