Inaitwa 'Kyuusoku Jikan'.

313
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:38,664
Ina umaarufu sana kwa watalii wa kigeni.

314
00:19:38,687 --> 00:19:41,620
'Kyuusoku Jikan'?

315
00:19:41,644 --> 00:19:44,513
Jina la ajabu!

316
