Ramani ni muhimu sana.

348
00:21:19,192 --> 00:21:21,031
Ndiyo.

349
00:21:21,054 --> 00:21:24,924
Nilitafuta njia za kubadilisha usafiri kila siku.

350
00:21:24,947 --> 00:21:26,718
