351
00:21:26,742 --> 00:21:30,708
Treni za Japani ni ngumu kidogo.

352
00:21:30,731 --> 00:21:32,345
Ndiyo.

353
00:21:32,368 --> 00:21:35,261
Niliwachupia picha nyingi.

354
00:21:35,285 --> 00:21:38,818
Nilitumia programu ya kutafsiri pia.

355
00:21:38,841 --> 00:21:41,575
Umeitumia sana!

356
