Sehemu ya 9: Chakula cha Safari na Kuokoa Pesa

400
00:24:01,615 --> 00:24:06,448
Baada ya simu, sasa ni suala la chakula.

401
00:24:06,471 --> 00:24:08,443
Chakula?

402
00:24:08,467 --> 00:24:12,442
Mikahawa ya Japani ilikuaje?

403
00:24:12,465 --> 00:24:15,665
Ilikuwa tamu sana.

404
00:24:15,688 --> 00:24:19,621
Lakini ilikuwa ghali kidogo.

405
00:24:19,644 --> 00:24:21,678
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

406
