Duka la bidhaa za kila siku lilikuwaje?

426
00:25:44,793 --> 00:25:48,926
Duka la bidhaa za kila siku pia, usiku hupungua bei.

427
00:25:48,949 --> 00:25:52,716
Ni rahisi zaidi kuliko kula mgahawani.

428
00:25:52,739 --> 00:25:54,939
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

429
00:25:54,962 --> 00:25:58,697
