Ndiyo. Ni rahisi na tamu, hivyo ni kama mbinguni kweli.

431
00:26:04,876 --> 00:26:09,255
Mbinguni? Hehe, ni mzuri sana.

432
00:26:09,278 --> 00:26:14,445
Ndiyo. Nilipokuwa na shida ya pesa, nilinusuru sana.

433
00:26:14,468 --> 00:26:18,884
Pia, ni nzuri wakati hujawahi kuhifadhi chumba mgahawani.

434
