Ndiyo, sehemu ya chini ya maduka makubwa usiku inapendekezwa sana.

438
00:26:38,900 --> 00:26:43,667
Ndiyo. Safarini ijayo, nitaenda usiku.

439
00:26:43,690 --> 00:26:45,190
Mandhari 10: Ununuzaji Akihabara / Ununuzaji Akihabara

440
