446
00:27:12,641 --> 00:27:18,449
Kulikuwa na maduka makubwa na ya kuvutia sana.

447
00:27:18,473 --> 00:27:21,406
Ulinunua kitu?

448
00:27:21,429 --> 00:27:25,762
Hapana, sikununua mengi.

449
00:27:25,785 --> 00:27:27,679
Kwa nini?

450
00:27:27,703 --> 00:27:33,436
Maduka maarufu yalikuwa na bei ghali kidogo.

451
00:27:33,459 --> 00:27:37,659
Aa, bei ya watalii.

452
00:27:37,682 --> 00:27:42,930
Ndiyo, kuna watalii wengi wa kigeni.

453
00:27:42,954 --> 00:27:44,754
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

454
00:27:44,777 --> 00:27:49,943
Kwa hiyo, hii pia ningependa kujua kabla ya kuja Japani.

455
00:27:49,966 --> 00:27:52,539
Ni hacks gani?

456
00:27:52,563 --> 00:27:58,163
Nenda madukani kidogo mbali na maeneo ya watalii.

457
00:27:58,186 --> 00:28:01,519
Maduka kidogo mbali?

458
00:28:01,542 --> 00:28:07,743
Ndiyo, maduka kama Book Off au Hard Off.

459
00:28:07,767 --> 00:28:10,900
Aa, maduka ya bidhaa zilizotumika.

460
00:28:10,923 --> 00:28:17,056
Ndiyo, kuna vitu vizuri na bei nafuu.

461
00:28:17,079 --> 00:28:19,496
Nimeelewa.

462
00:28:19,520 --> 00:28:26,814
Ndiyo, mchezo uliokuwa kwa bei ya yen 3000 Akihabara, ulikuwa kwa yen 1000 huko.

463
00:28:26,837 --> 00:28:30,708
Hiyo ni bei nafuu sana!

464
00:28:30,732 --> 00:28:34,966
Ndiyo, nilifurahi sana.

465
00:28:34,989 --> 00:28:39,522
Book Off ipo mahali pengi, sivyo?

466
00:28:39,545 --> 00:28:45,278
Ndiyo, ukitumia programu ya ramani, unaweza kuipata haraka.

467
00:28:45,301 --> 00:28:48,676
Ni mbali kidogo kwa treni.

468
00:28:48,699 --> 00:28:55,066
Ndiyo, ni mbali kidogo, lakini ni ya kuvutia kwenda.

469
00:28:55,089 --> 00:28:58,762
Ni nzuri pia unapoongea zawadi.

470
00:28:58,785 --> 00:29:04,385
Ndiyo, vitabu na CD pia ni bei nafuu sana.

471
00:29:04,408 --> 00:29:06,142
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

472
00:29:06,165 --> 00:29:11,414
Rafiki yangu mpenda otaku wa Japani alinipa dhumuni hili.

473
00:29:11,437 --> 00:29:13,971
Rafiki mwema.

474
00:29:13,994 --> 00:29:18,394
Ndiyo, nashukuru sana.

475
00:29:18,417 --> 00:29:23,350
Je, hii ni mwisho wa hadithi za safari yako ya Japani?

476
00:29:23,373 --> 00:29:27,312
Ndiyo, tumesema mengi.

477
00:29:27,335 --> 00:29:31,935
Ee, kuna mbinu nzuri nyingi.

478
00:29:31,958 --> 00:29:38,425
Ndiyo, safari ijayo itakuwa bora zaidi.

479
00:29:38,449 --> 00:29:43,182
Ndiyo, karibu tena Japani.

480
00:29:43,205 --> 00:29:47,104
Ndiyo, nitakuja tena bila shaka.

481
00:29:47,128 --> 00:29:48,628
Mandhari 11: Kula Sushi Kwa Furaha Mgahawani / Kula Sushi Kwa Furaha Mgahawani Maarufu

482
00:29:48,628 --> 00:29:54,699
Hii ni duka la sushi lililo maarufu sana hapa Japani.

483
00:29:54,722 --> 00:29:59,889
Leo tutakula sushi nyingi na tamu.

484
00:29:59,912 --> 00:30:02,927
Duka hili ni safi sana, sivyo?

485
00:30:02,950 --> 00:30:07,226
Huu ni upekee wa kitamaduni wa Japani.

486
00:30:07,249 --> 00:30:11,816
Ninahisi furaha kubwa sasa hivi.

487
00:30:11,839 --> 00:30:15,695
Kuna aina nyingi kwenye menyu.

488
00:30:15,718 --> 00:30:19,885
Unataka kuanza na samaki gani kwanza?

489
00:30:19,908 --> 00:30:25,675
Napenda sana samaki wa maguro wa Japani.

490
00:30:25,698 --> 00:30:30,376
Nitapanga maguro mbili kwanza.

491
00:30:30,399 --> 00:30:32,132
Sawa.

492
00:30:32,155 --> 00:30:37,322
Basi, nitawaagiza maguro kwa bwana.

493
00:30:37,345 --> 00:30:39,223
Vimefika.

494
00:30:39,247 --> 00:30:44,786
Rangi yake ni nzuri sana, na inaonekana tamu kabisa.

495
00:30:44,809 --> 00:30:47,380
Ni safi.

496
00:30:47,404 --> 00:30:50,604
Hakika itakuwa tamu.

497
00:30:50,627 --> 00:30:54,766
Tafadhali, weka mdomo wako kwanza.

498
00:30:54,789 --> 00:30:56,524
Asante.

499
00:30:56,547 --> 00:30:59,587
Eeh, tatizo!

500
00:30:59,611 --> 00:31:03,453
Wali umepasuka katikati.

501
00:31:03,476 --> 00:31:08,409
Aa, umekula sushi kwa vidole viwili.

502
00:31:08,432 --> 00:31:13,766
Inafaa ule sushi kwa kimoja ili iwe nzuri.

503
00:31:13,789 --> 00:31:16,434
Ni kweli hiyo?

504
00:31:16,457 --> 00:31:19,996
Ukubwa wake ni kidogo.

505
00:31:20,020 --> 00:31:24,586
Nimekula kwa sehemu mbili.

506
00:31:24,609 --> 00:31:27,743
Kwa nini ni bora kula kwa kimoja?

507
00:31:27,766 --> 00:31:35,140
Ukikula kwa sehemu mbili, wali utapasuka na kuanguka.

508
00:31:35,163 --> 00:31:37,034
Nimeelewa.

509
00:31:37,057 --> 00:31:42,524
Kweli ilivunjika kidogo, na ilikuwa vigumu kidogo kula.

510
00:31:42,548 --> 00:31:47,599
Fundi wa sushi huandaa kwa makini.

511
00:31:47,622 --> 00:31:51,903
Hii ndiyo saizi ya kunywa kwa mdomo mmoja yenye uwiano bora.

512
00:31:51,927 --> 00:31:57,215
Fundi ana uangalifu wa ajabu, sivyo?

513
00:31:57,238 --> 00:31:59,513
Sikuwa najua hilo.

514
00:31:59,537 --> 00:32:01,708
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

515
00:32:01,731 --> 00:32:07,265
Unakula samaki na wali pamoja kwa mdomo mmoja.

516
00:32:07,288 --> 00:32:10,721
Hiyo ndiyo njia bora ya kuonja ladha.

517
00:32:10,744 --> 00:32:13,417
Nimejifunza mengi leo.

518
00:32:13,440 --> 00:32:18,973
Mara inayofuata nitapanga salmon ninayopenda na kuonja.

519
00:32:18,996 --> 00:32:27,996
Unapowasha supu ya soya, weka kidogo kwenye samaki, si wali.

520
00:32:28,019 --> 00:32:32,986
Mara inayofuata nitakuwa makini na kula kwa mdomo mmoja vizuri.

521
00:32:33,009 --> 00:32:35,542
Unafanya vizuri sana!

522
00:32:35,565 --> 00:32:40,650
Kula kwa mdomo mmoja huonekana safi na mrembo.

523
00:32:40,674 --> 00:32:42,841
Ni safi sana!

524
00:32:42,864 --> 00:32:45,230
Kweli ndivyo.

525
00:32:45,253 --> 00:32:48,287
Nimekula yote kwa mdomo mmoja.

526
00:32:48,310 --> 00:32:51,511
Ladha inapanuka ndani ya kinywa.

527
00:32:51,535 --> 00:32:54,935
Ni ladha bora zaidi.

528
00:32:54,958 --> 00:32:58,191
Nimefurahi ukaipenda.

529
00:32:58,214 --> 00:33:03,081
Hii ndiyo njia sahihi ya kula sushi ya Kijapani.

530
00:33:03,104 --> 00:33:08,361
Kushika sushi kwa vijiti ni vigumu.

531
00:33:08,385 --> 00:33:12,251
Je, naweza kushika kwa mkono wakati huo?

532
00:33:12,274 --> 00:33:13,932
Ndiyo, bila shaka.

533
00:33:13,956 --> 00:33:17,523
Bila shaka unaweza kula kwa mkono pia.

534
00:33:17,546 --> 00:33:21,818
Hata nchini Japani, watu wengi hula kwa mikono.

535
00:33:21,841 --> 00:33:25,741
Kula kwa mkono siyo adabu mbaya, basi?

536
00:33:25,765 --> 00:33:29,831
Nimefurahi kusikia hivyo.

537
00:33:29,854 --> 00:33:33,654
Kwa hiyo, kutoka sasa utaweza kula kwa njia unayopenda.

538
00:33:33,677 --> 00:33:37,925
Oo, jaribu kula gari iliyo pembeni pia.

539
00:33:37,949 --> 00:33:41,820
Hiyo ni tangawizi nyepesi ya rangi pinki.

540
00:33:41,843 --> 00:33:45,376
Hii huliwa wakati gani?

541
00:33:45,399 --> 00:33:50,199
Huliwa kabla ya kula aina tofauti za samaki.

542
00:33:50,222 --> 00:33:53,625
Hutakasa kinywa chako.

543
00:33:53,649 --> 00:33:57,106
Samaki unaokula baadaye utakuwa mtamu zaidi.

544
00:33:57,129 --> 00:34:00,536
Hii ni mfumo wa ajabu sana!

545
00:34:00,560 --> 00:34:04,326
Sasa nimeelewa vizuri kanuni na adabu za kula sushi.

546
00:34:04,349 --> 00:34:09,549
Utamaduni wa chakula wa Kijapani una kanuni nyingi za kuvutia.

547
00:34:09,572 --> 00:34:12,643
Stahimili na uzoefu mengi.

548
00:34:12,667 --> 00:34:14,200
Ndiyo.

549
00:34:14,223 --> 00:34:20,956
Asante sana kwa kunifundisha jinsi ya kula sushi tamu leo.

550
00:34:20,979 --> 00:34:22,479
Sehemu ya 12: Changamoto za Maisha Nchini Japani na Adabu za Kijapani

551
00:34:22,479 --> 00:34:26,546
Maisha yangu nchini Japani yameanza.

552
00:34:26,569 --> 00:34:30,102
Masomo ya Kijapani kila siku yanaendelea vipi?

553
00:34:30,125 --> 00:34:33,404
Darasani ni ya kufurahisha sana.

554
00:34:33,428 --> 00:34:37,661
Lakini kuna mengi ya kukumbuka.

555
00:34:37,684 --> 00:34:40,817
Bado ni vigumu kidogo.

556
00:34:40,840 --> 00:34:43,494
Hii ni mazingira mapya kwako.

557
00:34:43,518 --> 00:34:45,815
Ni ngumu, sivyo?

558
00:34:45,839 --> 00:34:50,206
Je, kuna jambo lingine lolote linalokukosesha?

559
00:34:50,229 --> 00:34:57,598
Kwa kweli, nina mambo machache ya ajabu kuhusu adabu za Wajapani.

560
00:34:57,622 --> 00:35:00,057
Adabu?

561
00:35:00,080 --> 00:35:04,448
Kwa mfano, una wasiwasi gani?

562
00:35:04,471 --> 00:35:10,321
Hivi karibuni, nilimsalimia mwalimu wakati nilikuwa nikitembea ukingoni shuleni.

563
00:35:10,345 --> 00:35:13,878
Hii ni reaksheni ya mwalimu wakati huo.

564
00:35:13,901 --> 00:35:18,301
Eeh, mimi nilikuwa ninatazama kutoka nyuma.

565
00:35:18,324 --> 00:35:21,924
Kuna kitu kilichokukera?

566
00:35:21,947 --> 00:35:25,747
Mimi nilisema, "Habari za asubuhi."

567
00:35:25,770 --> 00:35:27,211
Nilisema hivyo.

568
00:35:27,234 --> 00:35:31,434
Nilikunja mikono mbele ya kifua na kupiga maguzo.

569
00:35:31,457 --> 00:35:33,124
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

570
00:35:33,147 --> 00:35:36,514
Nilikunja mikono vizuri pamoja.

571
00:35:36,537 --> 00:35:40,104
Nilipiga maguzo kwa kina.

572
00:35:40,127 --> 00:35:45,098
Lakini, mwalimu alionekana kuwa na mshangao kidogo.

573
00:35:45,121 --> 00:35:48,800
Je, adabu zangu zilikuwa zimekosea?

574
00:35:48,824 --> 00:35:50,359
Ndiyo.

575
00:35:50,382 --> 00:35:57,016
Kwa kweli nchini Japani, wakati wa salamu za kawaida, haitoshi kunja mikono.

576
00:35:57,039 --> 00:36:00,105
Aa, ni kweli hivyo?

577
00:36:00,128 --> 00:36:04,595
Nimefikiri kunja mikono kungekuwa adabu zaidi.

578
00:36:04,618 --> 00:36:09,856
Nchini kwangu, kwa kawaida tunashikamana au kubanana.

579
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:13,219
Japani ni nchi ya maguzo, sivyo?

580
00:36:13,242 --> 00:36:18,442
Kwa hiyo, nimefikiri kunja mikono ndiyo njia sahihi.

581
00:36:18,465 --> 00:36:20,199
Nimeelewa.

582
00:36:20,222 --> 00:36:23,642
Nimeona katika anime na filamu pia.

583
00:36:23,665 --> 00:36:29,879
Wageni nchini Japani wanapopiga maguzo, mara nyingi wanakunja mikono, sivyo?

584
00:36:29,902 --> 00:36:31,536
Ndiyo.

585
00:36:31,559 --> 00:36:36,963
Nimekuwa nikifikiri kwamba maguzo ya Japani, kila mtu hukunja mikono.

586
00:36:36,986 --> 00:36:39,920
Nilikuwa nimekosea.

587
00:36:39,943 --> 00:36:42,241
Ndiyo hivyo.

588
00:36:42,265 --> 00:36:48,031
Kwa watu ambao katika nchi zao kuna utamaduni wa kunja mikono, hakuna tatizo.

589
00:36:48,054 --> 00:36:52,388
Lakini kwa watu ambao utamaduni wao si wa aina hiyo...

590
00:36:52,411 --> 00:36:58,011
Wakati unapokuwa unasalimia nchini Japani, unaweza kuacha mikono chini.

591
00:36:58,033 --> 00:37:05,481
Ndiyo, watu wote wa Japani hawana mikono yao pamoja, kweli?

592
00:37:05,505 --> 00:37:07,139
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

593
00:37:07,162 --> 00:37:09,962
Nchini Japani, tunapiga mikono pamoja.

594
00:37:09,985 --> 00:37:13,273
Ni wakati maalum tu.

595
00:37:13,296 --> 00:37:17,944
Wakati maalum ni kama vipi, kwa mfano?

596
00:37:17,968 --> 00:37:24,236
Mara nyingi zaidi ni wakati wa kula chakula, tunaposema 'itadakimasu'.

597
00:37:24,259 --> 00:37:30,393
Aa, wakati wa kula chakula, watu wote wanapiga mikono pamoja, kweli?

598
00:37:30,416 --> 00:37:32,816
Je, kuna nyinginezo?

599
00:37:32,839 --> 00:37:40,132
Pia, wakati wa kwenda hekaluni au maabadi ya Mungu na kuomba mbele ya Mungu au Buddha.

600
00:37:40,155 --> 00:37:43,044
Kuomba kwa Mungu, ndiyo.

601
00:37:43,067 --> 00:37:46,119
Ninaelewa vizuri sana.

602
00:37:46,142 --> 00:37:49,276
Tunatumia hata katika mazungumzo ya kila siku.

603
00:37:49,299 --> 00:37:54,665
Ni wakati wa kuomba kwa nguvu mtu fulani, kama kusema 'Tafadhali sana!'

604
00:37:54,688 --> 00:37:58,022
Ni wakati wa kuomba rafiki yako, ndiyo.

605
00:37:58,045 --> 00:38:00,618
Wakati wa kuomba msamaha je?

606
00:38:00,641 --> 00:38:05,456
Unaposema 'Samahani kwa haraka!' wakati wa kuomba msamaha.

607
00:38:05,480 --> 00:38:10,053
Wakati huo, unaweza pia kupiga mikono pamoja.

608
00:38:10,076 --> 00:38:14,676
Katika salamu za asubuhi za kawaida, hawatakiwi kupiga mikono pamoja, kweli?

609
00:38:14,699 --> 00:38:16,299
Hapana.

610
00:38:16,322 --> 00:38:22,489
Katika salamu za kawaida, wanaume huweka mikono yao pembeni kwa mwili wao kwa mstari mmoja.

611
00:38:22,512 --> 00:38:24,650
Ndiyo hivyo.

612
00:38:24,673 --> 00:38:29,240
Kwa wanawake, je, wanapaswa kufanya nini ili waoneke vizuri?

613
00:38:29,263 --> 00:38:35,136
Wanawake kwa kawaida huweka mikono yao mbele ya mwili na kuziunganisha kwa utulivu.

614
00:38:35,160 --> 00:38:38,330
Nimejifunza sana.

615
00:38:38,353 --> 00:38:42,401
Kutoka kesho nitazoea jinsi sahihi ya kusali.

616
00:38:42,425 --> 00:38:45,825
Kila mtu anafahamu kwamba hakuna nia mbaya.

617
00:38:45,848 --> 00:38:48,921
Chukua muda wako wa kujizoea.

618
00:38:48,945 --> 00:38:51,978
Asante kwa maneno mazuri.

619
00:38:52,001 --> 00:38:56,040
Nafurahi kuelewa utamaduni halisi wa Japani.

620
00:38:56,063 --> 00:38:57,563
Sehemu ya 13: Foleni ya Mgahawa wa Ramen Unaopendwa

621
00:38:57,563 --> 00:39:04,697
Mgahawa huu wa ramen una foleni ndefu mbele ya duka kila wakati.

622
00:39:04,720 --> 00:39:06,686
Masomo ya Kijapani kila siku yanaendelea vipi?

623
00:39:06,709 --> 00:39:11,076
Harufu tamu sana inafika hata nje.

624
00:39:11,099 --> 00:39:13,984
Ina thamani ya kusubiri.

625
00:39:14,008 --> 00:39:16,466
Nafasi imetulia sasa.

626
00:39:16,489 --> 00:39:19,689
Tuvingie ndani na tuagize.

627
00:39:19,712 --> 00:39:26,346
Mimi nitachagua ramen ya supu ya soya iliyo juu ya orodha.

628
00:39:26,369 --> 00:39:31,335
Je, kuna jambo lingine lolote linalokukosesha?

629
00:39:31,358 --> 00:39:34,293
Aa, ramen imekuja.

630
00:39:34,317 --> 00:39:37,117
Chombo kina moto sana.

631
00:39:37,140 --> 00:39:42,307
Kwa mfano, una wasiwasi gani?

632
00:39:42,330 --> 00:39:45,747
Tafadhali, kula wakati bado ni moto.

633
00:39:45,770 --> 00:39:50,336
Lakini watu wanakula kimya sana.

634
00:39:50,359 --> 00:39:51,854
Ndiyo.

635
00:39:51,878 --> 00:39:57,351
Kuna kitu kilichokukera?

636
00:39:57,374 --> 00:40:00,308
Hiyo ni tabia mbaya sana.

637
00:40:00,331 --> 00:40:02,767
Nilisema hivyo.

638
00:40:02,791 --> 00:40:10,065
Lakini nchini Japani, ni sawa kusogea kwa sauti wakati wa kula ramen au noodles nyingine.

639
00:40:10,088 --> 00:40:13,298
Aa, kweli unaweza?

640
00:40:13,321 --> 00:40:17,255
Je, haitawasumbua watu wengine?

641
00:40:17,278 --> 00:40:20,346
Haitasumbua.

642
00:40:20,369 --> 00:40:25,936
Badala yake, kusema kwa sauti kunasemekana kuwa ni ladha nzuri zaidi.

643
00:40:25,959 --> 00:40:27,816
Ni ajabu.

644
00:40:27,839 --> 00:40:32,486
Kwa nini sauti kubwa inafanya iwe ladha nzuri?

645
00:40:32,509 --> 00:40:37,943
Unapokula noodles, unavuta hewa pamoja na hizo.

646
00:40:37,966 --> 00:40:41,983
Unaweza kunusa harufu nzuri ya supu vizuri sana.

647
00:40:42,007 --> 00:40:43,699
Nimeelewa.

648
00:40:43,722 --> 00:40:49,755
Unapokula pamoja na hewa, harufu inakuwa kali zaidi.

649
00:40:49,778 --> 00:40:51,781
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

650
00:40:51,804 --> 00:40:56,497
Na nyama moto inapozidi kupoa kidogo kwa hewa.

651
00:40:56,520 --> 00:41:00,120
Haitakuwa rahisi kuungua mdomo wako.

652
00:41:00,143 --> 00:41:02,977
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

653
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:06,179
Ramani mara zote ilikuwa moto mno.

654
00:41:06,202 --> 00:41:09,014
Kulikuwa na ugumu kwa kunywa.

655
00:41:09,037 --> 00:41:13,046
Tazama wateja wengine kwenye meza za kandokando.

656
00:41:13,070 --> 00:41:16,480
Wote wananyua sauti kubwa wakila.

657
00:41:16,504 --> 00:41:18,379
Kweli ndivyo.

658
00:41:18,402 --> 00:41:25,341
Husikii sauti kubwa 'zuzuzu' kutoka pande zote.

659
00:41:25,364 --> 00:41:30,531
Kwa hiyo, hapa hakuna haja ya kuona aibu.

660
00:41:30,554 --> 00:41:32,287
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

661
00:41:32,310 --> 00:41:35,585
Ninataka kuhisi utamaduni wa Kijapani.

662
00:41:35,609 --> 00:41:38,609
Mimi pia nitajaribu kwa bidii.

663
00:41:38,631 --> 00:41:40,965
Imekuwaje?

664
00:41:40,988 --> 00:41:45,921
Kwanza ni vigumu kidogo, lakini uliweza kunyua vizuri?

665
00:41:45,944 --> 00:41:48,188
Wakati maalum ni kama vipi, kwa mfano?

666
00:41:48,212 --> 00:41:53,485
Lakini ladha ya supu inakuwa tamu zaidi kuliko awali.

667
00:41:53,508 --> 00:41:55,641
Ni nzuri sana!

668
00:41:55,664 --> 00:42:01,342
Je, kuna nyinginezo?

669
00:42:01,366 --> 00:42:05,632
Utamaduni wa kunyua nyama ni wa kuvutia sana.

670
00:42:05,655 --> 00:42:09,922
Eeh, na wakati wa kunywa supu?

671
00:42:09,946 --> 00:42:12,912
Swali zuri!

672
00:42:12,935 --> 00:42:18,702
Wakati wa kunywa supu, shika bakuli kwa mikono yako miwili na kunywa kimya.

673
00:42:18,725 --> 00:42:23,813
Hivyo, wakati wa kunywa supu, usitoe sauti kubwa.

674
00:42:23,837 --> 00:42:26,604
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

675
00:42:26,627 --> 00:42:31,427
Wakati wa kuomba msamaha je?

676
00:42:31,449 --> 00:42:33,983
Ni supu ile ile ya ramen.

677
00:42:34,006 --> 00:42:37,772
Lakini kuna tofauti za adabu.

678
00:42:37,795 --> 00:42:40,562
Ni kina sana!

679
00:42:40,585 --> 00:42:42,084
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

680
00:42:42,107 --> 00:42:46,079
Eeh, umekunywa supu yote safi.

681
00:42:46,102 --> 00:42:49,547
Ndiyo, ilikuwa tamu sana.

682
00:42:49,571 --> 00:42:52,348
Kwa wanawake, je, wanapaswa kufanya nini ili waoneke vizuri?

683
00:42:52,371 --> 00:42:54,938
Hivyo ni rahisi zaidi.

684
00:42:54,961 --> 00:42:57,232
Nimependea.

685
00:42:57,255 --> 00:43:00,136
Nimefurahi umependea.

686
00:43:00,159 --> 00:43:04,926
Kila mtu anafahamu kwamba hakuna nia mbaya.

687
00:43:04,949 --> 00:43:07,982
Ndiyo, tuende basi.

688
00:43:08,005 --> 00:43:11,845
Mara inayofuata nitakunyua vizuri zaidi.

689
00:43:11,869 --> 00:43:13,369
Sehemu ya 14: Somo la Kutolea Viatu / Jinsi ya Kutolea Viatu Kwenye Mlango

690
00:43:13,369 --> 00:43:18,336
Asante kwa kuja nyumbani kwangu leo.

691
00:43:18,359 --> 00:43:21,216
Karibu ndani.

692
00:43:21,239 --> 00:43:23,506
Ninaingia.

693
00:43:23,529 --> 00:43:27,778
Ni mara yangu ya kwanza kuingia nyumbani kwa Kijapani.

694
00:43:27,801 --> 00:43:30,934
Nina wasiwasi sana.

695
00:43:30,957 --> 00:43:33,890
Aa, subiri kidogo.

696
00:43:33,913 --> 00:43:38,113
Jinsi ya kutolea viatu ni tofauti kidogo.

697
00:43:38,136 --> 00:43:39,750
Eeh?

698
00:43:39,774 --> 00:43:44,807
Je, nimekosea mahali pa kutolea viatu?

699
00:43:44,830 --> 00:43:47,597
Hapa ni genkan, sivyo?

700
00:43:47,620 --> 00:43:51,553
Ndiyo, mahali ni hapa.

701
00:43:51,576 --> 00:43:55,782
Lakini mwelekeo wa kutolea ni tofauti.

702
00:43:55,806 --> 00:43:58,039
Mwelekeo?

703
00:43:58,062 --> 00:44:02,029
Nilikuwa ninaelekea nyuma.

704
00:44:02,052 --> 00:44:05,926
Nilikuwa ninatoa viatu nikiwa nimeelekeza nyuma nyumbani.

705
00:44:05,949 --> 00:44:07,619
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

706
00:44:07,643 --> 00:44:14,695
Nchini Japani, si vizuri kutoa viatu ukielekeza nyuma nyumbani.

707
00:44:14,719 --> 00:44:19,156
Kwa nini si vizuri kutoa viatu ukielekeza nyuma?

708
00:44:19,179 --> 00:44:22,146
Hiyo ni rahisi zaidi.

709
00:44:22,169 --> 00:44:28,569
Si adabu nzuri kugeukia nyuma kwa watu walio ndani ya nyumba.

710
00:44:28,592 --> 00:44:30,404
Nimeelewa.

711
00:44:30,427 --> 00:44:35,605
Ni sawa na wakati wa kusalimia, kugeukia nyuma.

712
00:44:35,629 --> 00:44:38,766
Hiyo ni adabu mbaya.

713
00:44:38,790 --> 00:44:41,233
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

714
00:44:41,256 --> 00:44:47,070
Kwa hiyo, kwanza jiondoe viatu ukielekea mbele.

715
00:44:47,094 --> 00:44:51,465
Baada ya hapo, endelea kupanda juu.

716
00:44:51,488 --> 00:44:53,565
Sawa.

717
00:44:53,589 --> 00:44:57,832
Jiondoe viatu ukielekea mbele.

718
00:44:57,856 --> 00:45:00,534
Nitaweka mguu wangu hapa.

719
00:45:00,557 --> 00:45:03,391
Ndiyo, umeshika vizuri.

720
00:45:03,414 --> 00:45:09,780
Baada ya hapo, geuka na kupanga viatu vizuri.

721
00:45:09,803 --> 00:45:14,470
Geuka nyuma na kuchukua viatu kwa mkono.

722
00:45:14,493 --> 00:45:17,426
Unabadilisha mwelekeo nje, ndiyo?

723
00:45:17,449 --> 00:45:20,516
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

724
00:45:20,539 --> 00:45:25,872
Weka miguu ya viatu ikielekezwa kwenye mlango wa kuingia.

725
00:45:25,895 --> 00:45:28,751
Kuelekeza kwenye mlango, ndiyo?

726
00:45:28,775 --> 00:45:30,842
Hivi ni sawa?

727
00:45:30,865 --> 00:45:34,598
Ndiyo, ni kamili.

728
00:45:34,621 --> 00:45:41,354
Kisha utakapoondoka nyumbani, utavaa viatu mara moja.

729
00:45:41,377 --> 00:45:44,111
Ni rahisi sana.

730
00:45:44,134 --> 00:45:49,467
Kweli, hivi ni rahisi sana kuvava wakati wa kutoka tena.

731
00:45:49,490 --> 00:45:55,291
Kwenye mlango wa kuingia wa Kijapani, kuna adabu nyingi ndogo kama hizi.

732
00:45:55,314 --> 00:45:58,514
Ni ya kushangaza sana!

733
00:45:58,537 --> 00:46:02,271
Je, naweka viatu katikati?

734
00:46:02,294 --> 00:46:09,788
Hapana, katikati ndio njia ya familia na wageni wengine.

735
00:46:09,811 --> 00:46:12,545
Weka pembeni.

736
00:46:12,568 --> 00:46:14,501
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

737
00:46:14,524 --> 00:46:19,895
Basi, nitaweka viatu vyangu upande wa kulia pembeni.

738
00:46:19,919 --> 00:46:21,564
Asante.

739
00:46:21,587 --> 00:46:26,721
Umepanga vizuri sana na kwa ufasaha.

740
00:46:26,744 --> 00:46:29,744
Kuna mambo mengi ya kukumbuka.

741
00:46:29,767 --> 00:46:34,300
Lakini, adabu za Kijapani zina maana sana.

742
00:46:34,323 --> 00:46:38,723
Nashukuru kwa kunisema hivyo.

743
00:46:38,746 --> 00:46:42,014
Sasa, karibu kwenye sebule.

744
00:46:42,038 --> 00:46:44,721
Asante, naomba nijaze.

745
00:46:44,744 --> 00:46:47,944
Ningependa chai moto.

746
00:46:47,967 --> 00:46:51,767
Ndiyo, nitakayandalia mara moja.

747
00:46:51,790 --> 00:46:54,604
Pumzika polepole.

748
00:46:54,628 --> 00:46:56,275
Asante.

749
00:46:56,298 --> 00:47:00,588
Nyumba za Kijapani ni safi sana na zinatoa amani.

750
00:47:00,612 --> 00:47:04,887
Furahia muda wako.

751
00:47:04,910 --> 00:47:08,087
Leo tutazungumza mengi.

752
00:47:08,110 --> 00:47:11,277
Ndiyo, naomba utunzwe.

753
00:47:11,300 --> 00:47:16,742
Oo, mizigo yako unaweza kuweka kwenye sofa hiyo.

754
00:47:16,766 --> 00:47:18,454
Asante.

755
00:47:18,478 --> 00:47:21,447
Navaa koti wangu wapi?

756
00:47:21,470 --> 00:47:24,803
Nitakushughulikia koti.

757
00:47:24,826 --> 00:47:28,114
Nitakiweka kwenye henga kwenye mlango wa kuingia.

758
00:47:28,138 --> 00:47:29,638
Mlo wa 15: Mazungumzo kwenye Izakaya

759
00:47:29,638 --> 00:47:33,371
Umeshikamoo kwa kazi leo.

760
00:47:33,394 --> 00:47:37,603
Izakaya hii ni rahisi na ladha nzuri.

761
00:47:37,627 --> 00:47:39,827
Umeshikamoo.

762
00:47:39,850 --> 00:47:44,683
Nimekuwa nikitamani kutembelea Izakaya ya Kijapani kwa muda mrefu.

763
00:47:44,706 --> 00:47:48,473
Kwanza tutaagiza vinywaji.

764
00:47:48,496 --> 00:47:51,562
Mimi nitakunywa bia.

765
00:47:51,585 --> 00:47:54,957
Mimi nitakunywa chai ya Ulong.

766
00:47:54,981 --> 00:47:58,451
Nina njaa sana.

767
00:47:58,474 --> 00:48:00,155
Samahani.

768
00:48:00,179 --> 00:48:03,379
Tafadhali, nipe bia na chai ya Ulong.

769
00:48:03,402 --> 00:48:10,048
Aa, mhudumu ameleta sahani ndogo yenye chakula.

770
00:48:10,071 --> 00:48:13,317
Aa, hiyo ni o-tōshi.

771
00:48:13,340 --> 00:48:17,589
Chakula cha leo kinaonekana kama edamame.

772
00:48:17,613 --> 00:48:20,891
Eeh, o-tōshi?

773
00:48:20,914 --> 00:48:25,081
Mimi sikuiagiza hii.

774
00:48:25,104 --> 00:48:27,584
Ndio, naelewa.

775
00:48:27,607 --> 00:48:33,384
Lakini hii ni mfumo maalum wa izakaya za Kijapani.

776
00:48:33,407 --> 00:48:38,184
Ni ajabu kwamba chakula kinakuja ingawa sikuiagiza.

777
00:48:38,207 --> 00:48:41,977
Je, siyo kosa la mhudumu?

778
00:48:42,001 --> 00:48:45,568
Si kosa.

779
00:48:45,591 --> 00:48:50,682
O-tōshi ni kama ada ya kiti katika duka hili.

780
00:48:50,706 --> 00:48:53,143
Ada ya kiti?

781
00:48:53,167 --> 00:48:57,700
Hivyo ni sawa na table charge katika migahawa ya nje?

782
00:48:57,723 --> 00:48:59,693
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

783
00:48:59,717 --> 00:49:04,931
Hata katika migahawa ya nje, pengine ada ya kiti inahitajika, sivyo?

784
00:49:04,955 --> 00:49:07,322
Ndio, kuna.

785
00:49:07,345 --> 00:49:12,545
Lakini kuona chakula kikiletwa pamoja ni mara yangu ya kwanza.

786
00:49:12,568 --> 00:49:20,801
Nchini Japani, badala ya kukusanya ada ya kiti, mara nyingi huletwa chakula kidogo kama hiki.

787
00:49:20,824 --> 00:49:22,160
Nimeelewa.

788
00:49:22,184 --> 00:49:28,000
Ni furaha zaidi kupata chakula kuliko kulipa pesa tu.

789
00:49:28,023 --> 00:49:29,826
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

790
00:49:29,849 --> 00:49:35,983
Unaweza kula hiki wakati unangoja kinywaji chako cha kwanza kifike.

791
00:49:36,006 --> 00:49:39,212
Hiyo ni wazo zuri sana.

792
00:49:39,235 --> 00:49:42,929
Edamame hii inaonekana kuwa tamu sana.

793
00:49:42,953 --> 00:49:44,286
Ndiyo, inalingana sana na pombe na vinywaji vingine.

794
00:49:44,309 --> 00:49:48,201
Inalingana sana na pombe na vinywaji vingine.

795
00:49:48,224 --> 00:49:50,829
Tafadhali, jaribu kula.

796
00:49:50,853 --> 00:49:55,253
Ina chumvi nzuri na ni tamu sana.

797
00:49:55,276 --> 00:49:58,046
Naweza kupata nyingine?

798
00:49:58,069 --> 00:50:02,606
Kwa kawaida, huwezi kupata o-tōshi nyingine.

799
00:50:02,630 --> 00:50:06,497
Unaweza kuagiza kutoka kwa menyu.

800
00:50:06,520 --> 00:50:08,388
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

801
00:50:08,411 --> 00:50:13,583
Je, mfumo huu upo katika migahawa yote ya Japani?

802
00:50:13,607 --> 00:50:19,140
Hapana, migahawa ya kawaida au fast food haina mfumo huu.

803
00:50:19,163 --> 00:50:23,530
Ni utamaduni maalum wa izakaya pekee.

804
00:50:23,553 --> 00:50:26,386
Nimejifunza sana.

805
00:50:26,409 --> 00:50:32,748
Wakati wa malipo, ada ya o-tōshi huandikwa kwenye risiti.

806
00:50:32,772 --> 00:50:35,740
Bei ni kiasi gani kwa kawaida?

807
00:50:35,763 --> 00:50:37,737
Je, ni ghali?

808
00:50:37,760 --> 00:50:40,657
Inategemea duka.

809
00:50:40,680 --> 00:50:46,118
Lakini kwa kawaida ni kati ya senti 300 na 500.

810
00:50:46,142 --> 00:50:48,742
Hiyo ni bei nzuri.

811
00:50:48,765 --> 00:50:52,013
Nafurahi si ghali mno.

812
00:50:52,036 --> 00:50:57,970
Kama hutaki o-tōshi, kuna baadhi ya maduka ambayo unaweza kukataa.

813
00:50:57,993 --> 00:50:59,359
Eeh?

814
00:50:59,382 --> 00:51:02,256
Unaweza kukataa pia?

815
00:51:02,280 --> 00:51:03,925
Ndiyo.

816
00:51:03,948 --> 00:51:09,122
Lakini kwa wageni, maelezo yanaweza kuwa magumu.

817
00:51:09,146 --> 00:51:12,546
Ni rahisi zaidi kukubali.

818
00:51:12,569 --> 00:51:17,185
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

819
00:51:17,208 --> 00:51:20,059
Ni bora kula na kufurahia.

820
00:51:20,082 --> 00:51:21,715
Aa, bia na chai ya Ulong zimefika.

821
00:51:21,738 --> 00:51:26,505
Basi, tumwombe heri utamaduni wa izakaya ya Kijapani.

822
00:51:26,528 --> 00:51:31,968
Heri!

823
00:51:31,992 --> 00:51:33,764
Sasa tutaagiza chakula kitamu sana, sio hivyo?

824
00:51:33,787 --> 00:51:38,400
Ndiyo.

825
00:51:38,424 --> 00:51:39,722
Ndiyo.

826
00:51:39,745 --> 00:51:43,379
Ninafurahia sana kuangalia menyu hii.

827
00:51:43,402 --> 00:51:44,902
Sehemu ya 16: Tofauti za Kitamaduni katika Kulipa Bili / Tofauti za Kitamaduni katika Kulipa Bili

828
00:51:44,902 --> 00:51:49,180
Aa, nimekula sana.

829
00:51:49,204 --> 00:51:53,770
Hambaga hapa ilikuwa tamu sana.

830
00:51:53,793 --> 00:51:57,193
Ndiyo, ilikuwa tamu mno.

831
00:51:57,216 --> 00:52:00,715
Nyama ilikuwa lainifu, ilikuwa bora kabisa.

832
00:52:00,739 --> 00:52:03,805
Nimefurahi sana kuwa umenifurahisha.

833
00:52:03,828 --> 00:52:07,628
Basi, sasa tutaondoka kwa duka hapa?

834
00:52:07,651 --> 00:52:09,340
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

835
00:52:09,364 --> 00:52:13,497
Mwite mhudumu ili tuweze kulipa bili.

836
00:52:13,520 --> 00:52:16,654
Aa, subiri kidogo.

837
00:52:16,677 --> 00:52:20,532
Usitoe pochi yako mezani.

838
00:52:20,555 --> 00:52:23,407
Eeh, kwa nini?

839
00:52:23,430 --> 00:52:28,521
Baada ya kula, tunalipa pesa mezani, sivyo?

840
00:52:28,545 --> 00:52:33,635
Katika nchi yangu, tunampa mhudumu pesa mezani.

841
00:52:33,658 --> 00:52:37,102
Lakini hapa Japani ni tofauti?

842
00:52:37,126 --> 00:52:42,893
Ndiyo, katika mikahawa mingi ya Japani, hatulipi mezani.

843
00:52:42,916 --> 00:52:46,649
Basi, tutalipa wapi?

844
00:52:46,672 --> 00:52:51,742
Angalia karatasi ndogo iliyo mezani.

845
00:52:51,766 --> 00:52:55,619
Karatasi hii yenye namba nyingi?

846
00:52:55,642 --> 00:52:57,937
Hii ni nini?

847
00:52:57,961 --> 00:53:01,219
Hiyo ni deni.

848
00:53:01,243 --> 00:53:05,813
Kuna majina ya vyakula tulivyokagiza na bei zake.

849
00:53:05,837 --> 00:53:07,507
Nimeelewa.

850
00:53:07,530 --> 00:53:11,578
Nitume deni hii wapi?

851
00:53:11,601 --> 00:53:17,237
Chukua deni hiyo uende kwenye kaso karibu na ingresso ya duka.

852
00:53:17,261 --> 00:53:20,594
Tunalipa pesa kwenye kaso karibu na ingresso, sivyo?

853
00:53:20,617 --> 00:53:23,752
Je, hatuhitaji kuwaita wahudumu?

854
00:53:23,775 --> 00:53:27,790
Hapana, haitaji.

855
00:53:27,814 --> 00:53:33,249
Chukua deni uende kwenye kaso, mhudumu atakuhesabu.

856
00:53:33,272 --> 00:53:35,239
Nimeelewa.

857
00:53:35,262 --> 00:53:39,907
Ni tofauti kabisa na nchi yangu, nimegundua.

858
00:53:39,931 --> 00:53:45,864
Katika mikahawa ya kifahari au baadhi ya izakaya, unaweza kulipa mezani pia.

859
00:53:45,887 --> 00:53:50,087
Mahali pa kifahari unaweza kulipa mezani, sivyo?

860
00:53:50,110 --> 00:53:53,078
Kuna njia ya kutambua?

861
00:53:53,102 --> 00:53:58,535
Baada ya kula, mhudumu ataleta deni mezani.

862
00:53:58,558 --> 00:54:01,691
Hiyo ni ishara ya kwenda kwenye kaso.

863
00:54:01,714 --> 00:54:03,124
Nimeelewa.

864
00:54:03,148 --> 00:54:07,392
Ikiwa deni imekuwemo mezani, chukua uende kwenye kaso, sivyo?

865
00:54:07,415 --> 00:54:09,215
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

866
00:54:09,238 --> 00:54:13,804
Ikiwa hakuna deni, mwite mhudumu.

867
00:54:13,827 --> 00:54:17,761
Sema, 'Tafadhali, nataka kulipa bili'.

868
00:54:17,784 --> 00:54:19,717
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

869
00:54:19,740 --> 00:54:24,307
Mkahawa wa leo una deni, basi nitakwenda kwenye kaso.

870
00:54:24,330 --> 00:54:25,748
Ndiyo.

871
00:54:25,772 --> 00:54:32,464
Eeh, wakati wa kulipa, usimpe mhudumu pesa moja kwa moja.

872
00:54:32,487 --> 00:54:33,654
Eeh?

873
00:54:33,677 --> 00:54:35,713
Kupasha mikono si vizuri?

874
00:54:35,736 --> 00:54:39,170
Basi, nitatoa pesa wapi?

875
00:54:39,193 --> 00:54:42,967
Kuna kibao kidogo mbele ya kaso, sivyo?

876
00:54:42,990 --> 00:54:45,608
Weka pesa huko.

877
00:54:45,631 --> 00:54:48,831
Kibao hicho cha plastiki cha buluu, sivyo?

878
00:54:48,854 --> 00:54:51,492
Kwa nini ni lazima kuweka kwenye kibao?

879
00:54:51,516 --> 00:54:55,049
Ili pesa isianguke.

880
00:54:55,072 --> 00:54:59,405
Na pia ili mhudumu aweze kukagua pesa kwa urahisi.

881
00:54:59,428 --> 00:55:03,395
Kuna kanuni hadi kwenye sehemu ndogo, nimegundua.

882
00:55:03,418 --> 00:55:05,594
Nadhani ni mfumo wenye mantiki sana.

883
00:55:05,618 --> 00:55:10,184
Wakati wa kutumia kadi ya mkopo, weka kadi yako kwenye sinia.

884
00:55:10,207 --> 00:55:12,374
Hata kwa kadi pia?

885
00:55:12,397 --> 00:55:15,997
Miamala ya Japani ni ya kipekee sana, hivi ndivyo?

886
00:55:16,020 --> 00:55:19,458
Ukizizoea, utagundua ni rahisi sana na ya manufaa.

887
00:55:19,482 --> 00:55:22,260
Sasa, twende kwenye kasha la malipo.

888
00:55:22,283 --> 00:55:23,616
Ndiyo.

889
00:55:23,639 --> 00:55:27,806
Leo nitakulipa mimi, tafadhali nipe hati ya malipo.

890
00:55:27,829 --> 00:55:30,595
Aa, kweli unaweza?

891
00:55:30,618 --> 00:55:33,291
Asante.

892
00:55:33,315 --> 00:55:35,115
Asante kwa kunikaribisha.

893
00:55:35,138 --> 00:55:38,383
La, karibu sana.

894
00:55:38,407 --> 00:55:41,655
Tukutane tena tukala chakula kitamu pamoja.

895
00:55:41,678 --> 00:55:42,711
Ndiyo.

896
00:55:42,734 --> 00:55:46,001
Mara inayofuata nitakulipia mimi.

897
00:55:46,024 --> 00:55:47,524
Sehemu ya 17: Adabu za Lifti / Adabu za Kutumia Lifti

898
00:55:47,524 --> 00:55:50,724
Lifti imefika.

899
00:55:50,747 --> 00:55:53,814
Twende ndani pamoja.

900
00:55:53,838 --> 00:55:55,652
Asante.

901
00:55:55,675 --> 00:55:59,769
Ndani kuna watu wengi kidogo.

902
00:55:59,792 --> 00:56:01,792
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

903
00:56:01,815 --> 00:56:05,349
Sisi twende nyuma zaidi.

904
00:56:05,372 --> 00:56:09,338
Mimi ninasimama mbele ya kitufe.

905
00:56:09,361 --> 00:56:12,259
Aa, unasimama huko ndiyo?

906
00:56:12,283 --> 00:56:13,939
Ndiyo.

907
00:56:13,962 --> 00:56:16,962
Hapa hatutasumbua mtu.

908
00:56:16,985 --> 00:56:21,633
Aa, tumefika ghorofa tunayokwenda.

909
00:56:21,657 --> 00:56:25,623
Usishuke haraka.

910
00:56:25,646 --> 00:56:27,680
Eeh, kwa nini?

911
00:56:27,703 --> 00:56:31,469
Hii ndiyo ghorofa ninayotaka kushuka.

912
00:56:31,492 --> 00:56:36,581
Mtu anayesimama mbele ya kitufe ana jukumu maalum.

913
00:56:36,605 --> 00:56:39,499
Jukumu maalum?

914
00:56:39,522 --> 00:56:41,899
Ni nini hasa?

915
00:56:41,923 --> 00:56:47,736
Lazima uwe unabonyeza kitufe cha kufungua mpaka watu wote washuke.

916
00:56:47,759 --> 00:56:52,959
Unabonyeza kitufe kwa ajili ya watu wengine.

917
00:56:52,982 --> 00:56:54,876
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

918
00:56:54,899 --> 00:56:57,466
Unasaidia watu wote washuke.

919
00:56:57,489 --> 00:56:59,756
Sikuwa najua hilo.

920
00:56:59,779 --> 00:57:04,745
Nilikua nafikiri nitashuka mara tu nifikapo ghorofa yangu.

921
00:57:04,768 --> 00:57:09,702
Nchini Japani, mtu anayesimama mbele ya kitufe ndiye anayeshuka wa mwisho.

922
00:57:09,725 --> 00:57:13,458
Hiyo ni adabu nzuri sana.

923
00:57:13,481 --> 00:57:15,140
Hapana.

924
00:57:15,163 --> 00:57:19,296
Ni kanuni ili kila mtu aweze kutumia kwa furaha.

925
00:57:19,319 --> 00:57:22,258
Kuhusu kitufe cha kufunga?

926
00:57:22,282 --> 00:57:26,115
Bonyeza baada ya watu wote kuingia ndani.

927
00:57:26,138 --> 00:57:28,171
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

928
00:57:28,194 --> 00:57:33,128
Sasa, nitabonyeza kitufe cha kufungua kwa muda wote.

929
00:57:33,151 --> 00:57:34,524
Ndiyo.

930
00:57:34,547 --> 00:57:36,123
Unafanya vizuri.

931
00:57:36,146 --> 00:57:39,280
Watu wote wameshushuka.

932
00:57:39,303 --> 00:57:42,703
Sasa, sisi pia tushuke.

933
00:57:42,726 --> 00:57:44,559
Asante.

934
00:57:44,582 --> 00:57:46,149
Umenisaidia sana.

935
00:57:46,172 --> 00:57:50,544
Mara inayofuata nitajitahidi nikisimama mbele ya kitufe.